        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "All manipulations were performed in vacuo and under nitrogen using a modified Schlenk assembly. HOtBu (20 mL) was added to a solution of [Tb{N(SiMe3)2}3] (5.7 mmol) in hexane (25 mL) and THF (2 mL) at −195.80 °C. The mixture was stirred at room temperature for 24 h. Condensation and resolution in toluene (15 mL) followed by cooling at −20 °C produced colourless crystals of 1.",
